[node name="AreaLight3D" type="AreaLight3D" parent="." unique_id=372287465]
editor_description = "Baked into each room's lightmap by Project > Tools > Bake Room Lighting, and hidden in game.
Godot 4.7.1 bakes area lights about 2.18x brighter than it draws them live, so this energy (1.89) bakes to the live look of 4.118.
Range 2.72 m stops the glow at this ceiling's edges, so ceilings that face different ways meet without seams."
